+## Deployment
+
+Deployment flow: health checks → fix 503 (set Supabase Edge Function secrets) → Shopify pre-launch → PR → DNS → verify. See [NEXT_STEPS.md](NEXT_STEPS.md) and [SHOPIFY_SETUP_CHECKLIST.md](SHOPIFY_SETUP_CHECKLIST.md).
+
+**Bulk product upload (Edge Function)** — filled in for this project. Replace `{{AUTH_HEADER}}` with your admin JWT or use the `$ADMIN_TOKEN` env-var pattern.
+
+GET (health check, no auth):
+
+```bash
+curl -s "https://rgehleqcubtmcwyipyvi.supabase.co/functions/v1/bulk-product-upload"
+```
+
+200 = secrets OK; 503 = set SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN and SHOPIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN in Supabase → Edge Functions → Secrets.
+
+POST (admin JWT required):
+
+```bash
+curl -X POST "https://rgehleqcubtmcwyipyvi.supabase.co/functions/v1/bulk-product-upload" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer {{AUTH_HEADER}}" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"action":"create-shopify-product","product":{"title":"Test","price":"0.00","sku":"test","body":"","vendor":"","product_type":"","tags":""}}'
+```
+
+Or with env var:
+
+```bash
+export ADMIN_TOKEN="your-admin-jwt-here"
+curl -X POST "https://rgehleqcubtmcwyipyvi.supabase.co/functions/v1/bulk-product-upload" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $ADMIN_TOKEN" \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
+  -d '{"action":"create-shopify-product","product":{"title":"Test","price":"0.00","sku":"test","body":"","vendor":"","product_type":"","tags":""}}'
+```
+
+More: [docs/DEPLOYMENT_TEMPLATE.md](docs/DEPLOYMENT_TEMPLATE.md).
+
